### Signup author
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "post-file-update-author@example.com",
  "password": "password1234",
  "nickname": "postFileUpdateAuthor"
}


### Login author
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "post-file-update-author@example.com",
  "password": "password1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}


### Create post for update
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=post-update-create-boundary

--post-update-create-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryId"

1
--post-update-create-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Spring update target
--post-update-create-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

Post content before update.
--post-update-create-boundary--

> {%
    client.global.set("postId", response.body.data.postId);
%}


### Update post - multipart success with pdf
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=post-update-boundary

--post-update-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryId"

1
--post-update-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Updated Spring question
--post-update-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

Updated post content with an attached PDF.
--post-update-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="answer.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

%PDF-1.4 fake pdf content
--post-update-boundary--


### Update post - invalid file type
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=post-update-invalid-boundary

--post-update-invalid-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryId"

1
--post-update-invalid-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Updated Spring question
--post-update-invalid-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

Invalid update file type.
--post-update-invalid-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="memo.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

text file content
--post-update-invalid-boundary--


### Update post - missing title
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=post-update-missing-title-boundary

--post-update-missing-title-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryId"

1
--post-update-missing-title-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"


--post-update-missing-title-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

Updated post content.
--post-update-missing-title-boundary--
